          {
            "id": "cm6o1mjde001o3b79wwprdpgh",
            "data": {},
            "type": "text",
            "items": [
              {
                "id": "cm6o1mjde001u3b79jfguovcp",
                "heading": "<strong>Heading</strong>",
                "paragraph": "<div data-editor-id=\"6ae27c84-0c2f-4d26-9952-009774c9eb40\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.6rem\"><span style=\"color: black; text-decoration: inherit\">In today’s ever-evolving landscape, success is often seen as an individual achievement. However, the age-old wisdom, \"If you want to go fast, go alone. If you want to go far, go together,\" reminds us of the enduring power of a cohesive team. The dynamics of a team are fueled by responsibility, communication, and loyalty </span>— <span style=\"color: black; text-decoration: inherit\">three pillars that not only fortify the team structure, but also pave the way for group success.</span></span></p></div>"
              }
            ],
            "family": "text",
            "variant": "paragraph",
            "settings": {
              "cardMode": "WHITE",
              "paddingTop": 3,
              "quotesInline": false,
