          },
          {
            "id": "cm6o1n7u0002f3b79q8ti9awt",
            "data": {},
            "type": "interactive",
            "items": [
              {
                "id": "cm6o1n7u0002g3b79ocm29sf1",
                "type": "intro",
                "title": "",
                "isHidden": false,
                "description": "<div data-editor-id=\"5089e25e-d000-4f42-bc72-117120e76da7\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.7rem\"><span style=\"color: black; text-decoration: inherit\">Imagine a team as a chain, where each link represents an individual team member. When the links are strong and interconnected, the chain becomes unbreakable. In contrast, a weak link jeopardizes the integrity of the entire structure.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.3rem\">(Scroll through to complete this element)</span></p></div>"
              },
              {
                "id": "cm6o1n7u0002h3b7972vvk67c",
                "type": "summary",
                "title": "Reflect",
                "isHidden": false,
                "description": "<div data-editor-id=\"68eeb74a-1504-453a-9c86-e2bd78d2c9e5\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.7rem\"><span style=\"color: black; text-decoration: inherit\"><span style=\"color: black\">Now that we’ve discussed how some of these can help your team, consider how you can put these three principles into practice with those you lead.</span></span></span></p></div>"
              },
              {
                "id": "cm6o1n7u0002i3b79c0yhcbce",
                "type": "step",
                "media": {
                  "image": {
                    "key": "rise/courses/4STpSpUOKSse8xCu29ArA7fF3lCPEts4/kX65f8FJi0ATcdUR-AdobeStock_412229597.jpeg",
                    "type": "image",
                    "align": "center",
                    "fillWidth": false,
                    "crushedKey": "AdobeStock_412229597.jpg",
                    "dimensions": {
                      "originalWidth": 1680,
                      "originalHeight": 1120
                    },
                    "trackingId": "cm6o1n7u0002f3b79q8ti9awt",
                    "originalUrl": "AdobeStock_412229597.jpeg",
                    "sourcedFrom": "USER",
                    "useCrushedKey": true,
                    "trackingContext": "block:process"
                  }
                },
                "title": "Responsibility",
                "isHidden": false,
                "description": "<div data-editor-id=\"2fe7fb5c-f8dd-4762-bff6-57794f3fcf59\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.7rem\"><span style=\"color: black; text-decoration: inherit\">As discussed, responsibility goes beyond individual tasks. It</span>’<span style=\"color: black; text-decoration: inherit\">s about a collective commitment to the team's goals and objectives. Each team member plays a crucial role in the success of the team, and a strong sense of responsibility ensures that everyone is accountable for their actions.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.7rem\"><span style=\"color: black; text-decoration: inherit\">A responsible team is one where each member understands their role, takes ownership of their tasks, and contributes to the overall success of the team. This creates an environment where challenges are faced head-on, and setbacks become opportunities for learning and improvement.</span></span></p></div>"
              },
              {
                "id": "cm6o1n7u0002j3b798vkfkwe8",
                "type": "step",
                "media": {
                  "image": {
                    "key": "rise/courses/4STpSpUOKSse8xCu29ArA7fF3lCPEts4/4HaSjALtI4wNo6u_-AdobeStock_456361701.jpeg",
                    "type": "image",
                    "align": "center",
                    "fillWidth": false,
                    "crushedKey": "AdobeStock_456361701.jpg",
                    "dimensions": {
                      "originalWidth": 1680,
                      "originalHeight": 1120
                    },
                    "trackingId": "cm6o1n7u0002f3b79q8ti9awt",
                    "originalUrl": "AdobeStock_456361701.jpeg",
                    "sourcedFrom": "USER",
                    "useCrushedKey": true,
                    "trackingContext": "block:process"
                  }
                },
                "title": "Communication",
                "isHidden": false,
                "description": "<div data-editor-id=\"d69280dc-97e9-40ea-9d04-dcc73de1e575\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.7rem\"><span style=\"color: black; text-decoration: inherit\">Effective communication is the lifeblood of any successful team. It involves more than just conveying information; it</span>’<span style=\"color: black; text-decoration: inherit\">s about understanding, collaboration, and creating an atmosphere where ideas can flow freely. Teams that communicate well take advantage of the collective intelligence of their members, resulting in innovative solutions and championship-level performance.</span></span></p></div>"
              },
              {
                "id": "cm6o1on9500303b79mvm86at0",
                "type": "step",
                "media": {
                  "image": {
                    "key": "rise/courses/4STpSpUOKSse8xCu29ArA7fF3lCPEts4/GHKnLt_ZM-vQVs7x-AdobeStock_577031151.jpeg",
                    "type": "image",
                    "align": "center",
                    "fillWidth": false,
                    "crushedKey": "AdobeStock_577031151.jpg",
                    "dimensions": {
                      "originalWidth": 1680,
                      "originalHeight": 1120
                    },
                    "trackingId": "cm6o1n7u0002f3b79q8ti9awt",
                    "originalUrl": "AdobeStock_577031151.jpeg",
                    "sourcedFrom": "USER",
                    "useCrushedKey": true,
                    "trackingContext": "block:process"
                  }
                },
                "title": "Loyalty",
                "isHidden": false,
                "description": "<div data-editor-id=\"9b05fd63-de04-4525-b920-f05b2762b3ce\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.7rem\"><span style=\"color: black; text-decoration: inherit\">Last but not least, a shared sense of loyalty to each other and an organization fosters a sense of unity, trust, and camaraderie among team members. Loyalty within a team is not blind allegiance but a deep commitment to the shared goals and values. It</span>’<span style=\"color: black; text-decoration: inherit\">s the glue that holds a team together during challenging times and propels them toward shared successes.</span></span></p></div>",
                "isNewlyInserted": true
              }
            ],
